<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?><p:notes xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main" xmlns:r="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/relationships" xmlns:p="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/presentationml/2006/main"><p:cSld><p:spTree><p:nvGrpSpPr><p:cNvPr id="1" name=""/><p:cNvGrpSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvGrpSpPr><p:grpSpPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="0" y="0"/><a:ext cx="0" cy="0"/><a:chOff x="0" y="0"/><a:chExt cx="0" cy="0"/></a:xfrm></p:grpSpPr><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="2" name="Notes body"/><p:cNvSpPr txBox="1"/><p:nvPr><p:ph type="body" idx="1"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="685800" y="914400"/><a:ext cx="5486400" cy="7315200"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" rIns="0" tIns="0" bIns="0" anchor="t"/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="105000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="300"/></a:spcAft><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="0" i="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222B31"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial"/><a:ea typeface="Arial"/><a:cs typeface="Arial"/></a:rPr><a:t xml:space="preserve">Contribution, artifact, claim, evidence chunk and incident root are separate objects. Stable opaque IDs and SHA-256 content versions bind records to source spans. Claims use actual source-parent links; ambiguous heuristic attribution is unknown. Chunks inherit all relevant parent restrictions. Principal turns stay assigned to the existing user principal, not to a synthetic external contributor. An innocent relay/uploader is not automatically the origin. Known provenance defines common roots for copies; identical text alone does not make independent submissions one incident. Batches are synthetic statistical groups, not derivation edges. The controlled “authenticated_external” enum means the trusted synthetic mapping is accepted in this experiment; it is not a claim that real authors were authenticated. Missing/cyclic permissions and inconsistent mappings fail closed.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1200"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="105000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="300"/></a:spcAft><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="0" i="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222B31"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial"/><a:ea typeface="Arial"/><a:cs typeface="Arial"/></a:rPr><a:t xml:space="preserve"></a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1200"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="105000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="300"/></a:spcAft><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="0" i="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222B31"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial"/><a:ea typeface="Arial"/><a:cs typeface="Arial"/></a:rPr><a:t xml:space="preserve">SOURCES</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1200"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="105000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="300"/></a:spcAft><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="0" i="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222B31"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial"/><a:ea typeface="Arial"/><a:cs typeface="Arial"/></a:rPr><a:t xml:space="preserve">- src/ams/research/retrieval/metadata.py</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1200"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="105000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="300"/></a:spcAft><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="0" i="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222B31"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial"/><a:ea typeface="Arial"/><a:cs typeface="Arial"/></a:rPr><a:t xml:space="preserve">- src/ams/research/dynamic/models.py</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1200"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="105000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="300"/></a:spcAft><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="0" i="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222B31"/></a:solidFill><a:l